<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were moderately active. Compared with last Wednesday, both classes were $0.50 lower.</p>
<p>Steers - part load choice 3 Blacks near 1400 lbs 68.50.</p>
<p>High select and choice 2-3 1150-1400 lbs 66.00-67.00. Select and choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 64.00-66.00. Select 1-2 61.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - high select and choice 2-3 1025-1250 lbs</p>
<p>65.50-66.75. Select and choice 2-3 1000-1125 lbs 63.50-65.50. Select 1-2 61.00-63.50.</p>
</text>
